	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The very next day, I begin my training with Kogitsunemaru.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I face across from Koyuzu in the Imperial Temple's dojo.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Let us begin.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I take Kogitsunemaru from Koyuzu's hands.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"It's a short, lightweight blade.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Clearly made with a different objective in mind than slicing through the heavy armor of a chariot.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You can feel the spellforce flowing through it, right? It's just like any other spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Why don't you start by giving it a try?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"As soon as I draw the blade, its magicks flow through my palm into my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hm...?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I'm struck by a strange sensation.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"One of spellforce gathering above my head and behind my waist, even though there shouldn't be anything there.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There doesn't seem to be a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, quite... pfft...”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Koyuzu's shoulders quiver uncontrollably.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry. You seem like a totally different person...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I never could have imagined how dangerous the sight of you putting on some ears and a tail would be...”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ears and a tail... Oh.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"I reach around behind my waist.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"A fluffy fox tail is jutting out from the hem of my jacket.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"And the odd feeling above my head must be the fox ears.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I could probably wriggle them around if I concentrated.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it really that funny?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I don't think anyone could possibly withstand it.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I'm not sure I understand it myself.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Feeling a sensation like a faint breeze caressing the nape of my neck, I whirl around on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I stare intently at the heavy double doors of the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Somehow, I can tell that two people are approaching from the other side.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“What is the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Someone's coming.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"As I focus my senses, their presence becomes more vivid, and I'm able to sense each of their individual movements.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"One pair of footfalls has the characteristic gait of a warrior─a very skilled one, at that.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"That must be Hotori, without a doubt.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The other pair of light and elegant footfalls must be Akari's.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Clearly, my senses are many times sharper than usual.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"So this is the power of Kogitsunemaru.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's one impressive ability.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's incredible that you can use it so well.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“D-Do you think so?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Once you have gotten used to it, you will be able to extend your senses even further.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Though, it is important to maintain control.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“In crowded environments, it is easy to be overwhelmed by all of the sensory information you take in.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"It sounds like Kogitsunemaru won't be easy to master.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"My thoughts are interrupted by the opening of the dojo doors.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're here to lend a hand!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everything going all right?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, no problem.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"I try wriggling my fox ears as I reply.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Hotori"},
			{
"“Pfft!” “*Cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The two burst into laughter at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hey, don't make me laugh like that!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What a cowardly sneak attack! *Cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“See? What did I tell you?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You'd be able to slay anyone in the world as you are right now.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Koyuzu declares with a triumphant grin.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I still don't quite understand it myself...",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's my point.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I fall flat on my butt, the tip of Hotori's wooden blade hanging right before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...You got me.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've still got a long ways to go.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hotori withdraws her blade, offering me her free hand.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I grasp it and pull myself to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Right now, I'm training to evade Hotori's attacks using\nKogitsunemaru's power.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"With Kogitsunemaru, I'm able to keenly sense the intent behind each of her strikes.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wow, Kogitsunemaru's incredible.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He was able to dodge Inou's attacks for more than ten minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“No, what's truly incredible are Tokita-san's reflexes.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“If I were in his place, I would not be able to dodge in time even if I could sense it coming.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The two sitting on the sidelines are impressed.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san, would you care to take a break?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"My body feels heavy, likely due to me using this unfamiliar power for the first time.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"As I return Kogitsunemaru to its sheath, the magicks flowing through my body immediately dissipate.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa there...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san, are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The fatigue from using this unfamiliar power hits me all at once, and Koyuzu rushes up to support me as I stagger on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks for that.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Koyuzu does not respond when I thank her, pointedly averting her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Come to think of it, Hotori once mentioned that Koyuzu only reacts happily when praise for her is accompanied by headpats.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“N-No problem... ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Koyuzu giggles as I stroke her head.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"She narrows her eyes in blissful contentment as she leans into my hand.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haauh...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Wait a m─! Wh-Why are you petting me?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Despite her protests, however, she doesn't brush my hand aside.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I can't replace Koyuzu's family, but maybe I can at least help ease her loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"So I think as I continue to stroke Koyuzu's head.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I apparently had a younger sister before the war.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Perhaps I used to stroke her head just like this.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Somehow, the ever-present hollowness in my heart grows a little lighter.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Deep down, am I also searching for a replacement for my own family?",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“T-Tokita-san...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“How long do you intend to keep petting me?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Koyuzu whispers, squirming awkwardly beneath my hand.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oops, sorry about that.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Even after I remove my hand, Koyuzu's cheeks remain flushed for some time.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Once we notice the sunlight streaming in through the dojo windows turning orange, we decide to call it a day.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"My body still feels sluggish from using so much of\nKogitsunemaru's power.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hope things go better next time.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"In the end, I was never able to dodge Hotori's attacks for any longer than a dozen or so minutes.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"It still doesn't feel like I'm able to draw out all of\nKogitsunemaru's capabilities.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I'll definitely need to do more training.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You said it. I sure wasn't expecting it to be so hard.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At least you didn't get beaned right in the head... Oww...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You can't blame me for moving so weirdly.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, you didn't have to swing that hard!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Akari clutches the lump on her head with teary eyes.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"She wanted to try out the same training I was doing out of curiosity, and this is how it turned out.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'm amazed you got away with just a lump.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I probably would've gotten my head split right open.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You realize I was wearing my Artifact, right?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Chatting idly, the four of us continue walking home.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Eventually, we reach the junction where our paths diverge.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, Koyuzu and I are heading this way.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, see you tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Akari and I split off from them and begin walking our own way.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"With Koyuzu still on my mind, I turn to look behind me.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"I notice Koyuzu's gaze similarly lingering in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"She seems to hesitate when our eyes meet, but then she offers me a demure wave.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"It brings a smile to my face, and I wave back at her.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Koyuzu?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"When I answer honestly, Akari simply shrugs her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Tokita-san and Miyaguni-san depart in the direction of the flower shop.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Before I know it, I find myself tracing his receding figure with my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Tokita-san suddenly turns around.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"As our eyes meet, the sensation of his warm hand stroking my head comes surging back.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I'm unable to put it into words, but whenever he lays those big hands of his on my head, it fills me up with a comforting sense of security.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"It's a wholly different sensation compared to the happiness I feel when Hotori-sama pets me.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"...I should've been more honest and asked him to do it a while longer.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"But at the same time, I do still harbor some feelings of hostility toward him.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Unable to sort out the confusing emotions swirling inside me, I simply wave at Tokita-san.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Seeing me wave, he smiles and waves back.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, let's get going, too.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I fall into step an arm's length behind Hotori-sama.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm relieved to see you getting along with Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You've always kept your distance from him, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“A-Are you sure you aren't imagining things?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thought I wouldn't notice?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Hotori-sama flashes a refreshing smile.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Plus, you've gotten a little more cheerful.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“H-Have I really?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You sure have. Anything good happen to you recently?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Tokita-san's face immediately pops up in my mind.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Recalling the comforting sensation of him petting me makes the top of my head go all ticklish.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ahh!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Suddenly realizing the expression I'm making, I hastily wipe the grin from my face.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“A-Absolutely nothing! Nothing has happened to me at all!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I shake my head in vigorous denial.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Yet I can feel that my cheeks are burning so hot that no amount of shaking will cool them down.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“See? I told you you've gotten more cheerful.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehehee, Tokita, you dog.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san has absolutely nothing to do with it!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, you will always be the only person who has my devotion, Hotori-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I know, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Hotori-sama lays her hand on my head.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It makes me glad to know you look up to me.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But Koyuzu...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Learning to accept your true feelings is an important aspect of growing up.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Hotori-sama's uncharacteristically tender tone of voice gives me pause.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Try to not make the same mistakes that I did.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Hotori-sama laughs lightly as she walks on ahead.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Please, wait, Hotori-sama! What did you mean by that?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahaha! You'll have to figure that out yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-samaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Koyuzu and I begin making our way home once the Sworn Blades meeting is adjourned.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The two of us are passing through the narrow alleyways of Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Since I started training with Kogitsunemaru, I've rarely been apart from Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san, what should we do about training today?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's just do the usual.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“All right, let's head for the dojo then!”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The two of us have been at our training for several days now, and I feel like the distance between us has grown closer.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"I've gotten used to the burden Kogitsunemaru places on me by now, and I'm able to dodge Hotori's attacks almost perfectly.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Tomorrow is the day we commence our spellblade retrieval operation against Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Hopefully, we never end up in a situation where I need to use Kogitsunemaru in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"As I fall still, deep in thought, Koyuzu turns to look up at me with a puzzled expression.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Side by side, the two of us continue on our way past the teeming street stalls of Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Suddenly, Koyuzu comes to a stop in front of a stall selling knick-knacks and accessories.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Her eyes are glued to the assortment of tiny figures on display.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"The charmingly sculpted trinkets are all modeled after different animals.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Koyuzu seems to take particular interest in one shaped like a fox.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You want it?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“N-No, of course not!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Before our very eyes, another woman buys the fox trinket.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, ooh... The fox...”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"It appears to have been the last one, as there aren't any more foxes on display.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give me a minute.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I lay a hand on Koyuzu's head.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"She fidgets awkwardly, but doesn't offer any resistance.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"After a few good pats on the head, Koyuzu turns pliant and docile.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Taking my hand off her head, I call out to the shopkeeper.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Wow...!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Koyuzu's eyes light up as I place the fox trinket into her palm.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Fortunately, they still had some in stock.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Koyuzu looks back and forth between me and the tiny fox in her hands.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san, thank you so much!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll be sure to treasure it... ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Koyuzu giggles with delight as she admires the figure from all directions.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've been laughing a lot more recently.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a nice change of pace from how you were before.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Th-That's not true.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Koyuzu objects, even as she refuses to meet my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She must have realized it herself.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"I feel like if I press a little further now, she'll answer me honestly.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know, I always thought you hated me.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“N-No, not particularly.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd like to know why, if you wouldn't mind me asking.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"This is the second time I've broached this subject.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"But unlike last time, she doesn't immediately reject me.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"In fact, she seems to be wavering on whether she should tell me the truth.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, I'd really appreciate you telling me.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"I leave it at that, waiting for Koyuzu to speak up herself.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Her eyes dart about for some time, but eventually, she slumps her shoulders as though resigning herself.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I was... jealous of you.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Jealous?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Because Hotori-sama only ever talks about you.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I see. So that's why.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama has been watching over me ever since I lost my family.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Almost as though she was my real family.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But Hotori-sama... she was always more worried about you than me.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I knew it was nothing more than childish jealousy.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But still, it felt as though you were taking my one and only relative away from me.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"There's hardly a warrior alive who didn't lose family in the war.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"They all try their best to push through their grief in order to fight against the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"But not everyone is capable of that.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"There are plenty of warriors like Koyuzu who are simply unable to overcome their sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"And many other warriors who are haunted by the memories of their family even as they struggle on against our enemy.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"“Even if I were to tell you, Tokita-san, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you would never understand.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Koyuzu must have said that because I've lost all my memories from before the war.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"The warmth of family, and the loneliness of losing that warmth─those are things I could never hope to truly understand.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"But that's precisely why I feel so much sympathy for the girl before me.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It must have really bothered you seeing an amnesiac like me steal all of Hotori's attention.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, that's not...”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Koyuzu trails off, looking down.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I've only been thinking about myself.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You must have been suffering just as much...”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Koyuzu trails off once again.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"She seems like she's on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Though in very different ways, Koyuzu and I are both tormented by the scars of war.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"But because of that, we just might be able to comfort each other.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"I lay my hand on Koyuzu's head once again.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san?”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently, I had a younger sister before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I probably used to pet her on the head just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Not shrinking away from my hand, Koyuzu silently looks up at me.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I think about it like that, it makes me feel a little bit better about not being able to remember my family.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Me too.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Whenever you pet me like this... it makes me feel a little bit better.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What the heck. If we're both so lonely, what's wrong with comforting each other?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Koyuzu wipes the tears from her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Pfft, what's that supposed to mean?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Koyuzu finally shows me a smile.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"The sight of her smile inexplicably makes me want to ruffle her hair.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Aaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Jeez, Hotori-sama always treats me much more gently.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Heheh, is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I gently smooth down her hair, as though I'm petting a puppy.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san. Right now, I don't feel as lonely as I usually do.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“So I wouldn't mind... if you wanted to pet me some more.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Koyuzu leans closer to me, our shoulders brushing against each other.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"The thought that I've managed to alleviate Koyuzu's loneliness fills me up with a sense of fulfillment.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"And as I spend more and more time with Koyuzu, the hollowness in my heart where the memories of my family should be are also slowly being filled.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"But what will happen once we manage to retrieve her\nfamily's spellblade?",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"I suppose we'll go back to only ever seeing each other on Sworn Blades missions...",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"But will reclaiming her family's memento really be enough to fill the hole in her heart?",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Or will she only end up with more of the same loneliness that gnaws at her heart, even now?",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"I resolve myself to spend more time with Koyuzu, even after all this is over.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"I'm sure that I'll be able to find some excuse or other, like doing more training together.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ready to get going?”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"She lets out a disappointed yelp as I remove my hand.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ready to get going?”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"As Tokita-san takes his hand off my head, I inadvertedly open my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Thinking about our plans for tomorrow, I fall into step alongside him.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"The thought that I'll be able to reclaim the memento of my family brings me joy.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"But at the same time, I'm filled with a sense of loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"If our operation succeeds, I will no longer be able to spend time with Tokita-san like this.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"The thought of that sends a twinge through my heart.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"Despite the gloominess swirling within me, my heart starts to beat a little faster.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"He leans down to peer into my face, and my heart races even faster.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“N-Nothing! Nothing at all!”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Come on, let's get going!”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"I do my best to smile and stammer out an excuse as I run ahead.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"...Because if I don't, he'll be able to see the blush on my cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"Sitting on a bench in the courtyard, I check the time on my cell phone once again.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"Fifty minutes have elapsed since class started.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(She's late...)”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"I look up at the window of the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"It's been over thirty minutes since Koyuzu infiltrated the school through that window.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"The plan itself is exceedingly simple.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"As soon as Elsa heads off to swimming class, Koyuzu will slip into the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"There, she'll switch the spellblade for a replica before making her escape.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"It should be a simple matter.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"She managed to slip into the student council office without a hitch.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"Akari also contacted us to confirm that Elsa didn't bring the spellblade with her to the pool.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"All Koyuzu needs to do is switch the spellblade in the student council office with the fake─",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"But there hasn't been any contact from her ever since the operation began.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"She needs to act quickly, before Elsa and the other student council members come back.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"At that moment, my cell phone rings.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"I answer immediately as soon as I see that it's a call from Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, what's your status?”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Everything's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you located the spellblade?”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“That's the problem... Her desk drawer is locked.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll need a bit of time in order to pick the lock. How many more minutes until class ends?”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Only a few. Be quick about it!”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, it's open!”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Great. Now switch it with the fake.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...!”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"Turning to glance behind me, I suddenly notice several black cars pulling up in front of the school gates.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"A middle-aged Republican man steps out from one of them.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"A row of gaudy medals glitter on the lapel of his military uniform.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"It looks like a Republican VIP has come to inspect the academy.",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is bad. A bunch of Republican soldiers just arrived.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like... they're escorting a VIP on an inspection tour.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Why'd it have to be today of all days?”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"The original plan was for Koyuzu to exfiltrate through the same window she came in.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"But now, there are Republican soldiers keeping a close watch of the school building.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"She'll definitely be spotted if she tries to escape through the window.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Escape out through the hallway.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Um, there's been students chatting right outside the door for some time now.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"Well, this isn't good.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"I pull my cell phone away from my ear to check the time once again.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"Class will be over any minute now.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Before long, Elsa will be back at the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"...What do we do?",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"If she can't leave through the hallway, then the window is her only option.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			{
"But there are soldiers watching the window.",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, drop Kogitsunemaru out the window.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh? What are you intending to do?”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll distract the soldiers outside. You take that opening to escape.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You can't!”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's our only option. Trust me.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...All right.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			{
"After a moment of silence, Koyuzu agrees.",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're out of time. Drop it right now.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"The window of the student council office opens slightly, and out tumbles Kogitsunemaru.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"I catch it in my arms and immediately unsheathe the spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"Its magicks flow into my body, sharpening all my senses.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"Time to put all my training to use─",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"Sneaking up behind an unwary soldier, I incapacitate him with a silent strike.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"I pick up his rifle and point it upwards.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"As soon as I let off a burst of gunfire, I immediately move to reposition myself.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"I let off several more bursts, drawing all the soldiers' attention in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"I raise a commotion all the way to the back of the school before stealthily doubling back around to the front gate.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"There, I use my sharpened senses, courtesy of Kogitsunemaru, to check on the movements of the soldiers\nI'm unable to see.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Good, they've taken the bait.)”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"I can tell that all the soldiers are rushing to the back gate.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"Now Koyuzu won't be spotted if she escapes through the window.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"Hiding in the shadows, I check my cell phone.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"There's a single message from Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"“Escape successful.”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"Great.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(No, not yet.)”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"I'm still holding on to Kogitsunemaru.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"I have to return this back to Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			{
"I strain my fox ears, checking to see if anyone is in the vicinity of the front gate.",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"I detect only a single presence.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"There's no aura of malice about them, and they don't seem to have noticed me either.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"Those light and elegant footfalls could only belong to one person.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Elsa.)”",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"She's a tricky opponent, but my only way out is past her.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"Imbuing my body with Kogitsunemaru's magicks, I prepare for a sneak attack.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"─I will not ask for your forgiveness.",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"Whispering this in my heart, I charge Elsa as she barks orders to her soldiers over the radio.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"Suddenly, a cold chill runs up my spine.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"Sharpened by Kogitsunemaru, my senses pick up on a potent aura of lethality.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"I twist my body without thinking in the same instant a gunshot rings out.",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"A blast of hot air passes by my ear, and I hear the bullet embedding itself in the ground behind me.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			{
"The smoking muzzle of a gun peeks out from under Elsa's arm, her back still turned.",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"She shot without even looking behind her.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Not bad.)”",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I missed.”",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			{
"She hisses in frustration.",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"But by the time the words leave her mouth, I've already closed the distance.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Aamph!”",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			{
"I bowl past Elsa, covering her head with a jacket I stole from another soldier.",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough...!* Hold it right there!”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"Naturally, I do nothing of the sort.",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			{
"Skulking across rooftops and alleyways, I eventually manage to make it back to the shop.",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			{
"Without Kogitsunemaru's abilities, I surely would have been spotted by the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			{
"The first thing I see when I poke my head inside the shop is Koyuzu, curled up in a chair behind the counter.",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			{
"Akari is standing behind her, a comforting hand on\nKoyuzu's shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry I'm a little late.”",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san!”",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"She runs up to me, looking on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You're not just a little late!”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			{
"I lay my hand on Koyuzu's head as she rains her fists against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad you're safe.”",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry to make you worry.”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tell that to Inou, too.”",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			{
"Akari breathes a sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, that sure was some bad luck. Who would've thought an inspection would happen today of all days?”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa's probably suspicious of me.”",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But hey, it's not like you stole anything.”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right. All we did was replace the real thing with a fake.”",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"Akari smiles mischievously at my reply.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, give me your hand.”",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			{
"Koyuzu peers up at me through her tears.",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"I take Kogitsunemaru out from my pocket and place it in\nKoyuzu's open palms.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"For several seconds, Koyuzu simply stares down at the spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ooh, ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			{
"Until finally, she begins sobbing softly.",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			{
"One teardrop after another falls down upon Kogitsunemaru.",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			{
"Koyuzu clutches the spellblade to her chest.",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			{
"In the same way that she might embrace her family.",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Thank goodness! Thank goodness you are safe, Tokita-san!”",
			},
		},
		[437]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Thank you so much.”",
			},
		},
		[438]={
			{
"People passing by the shop take sidelong glances at the crying Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[439]={
			{
"I gently fold her head into my arms as she continues to quietly sob.",
			},
		},
		[440]={
			{
"I don't want anyone else to be able to see her tears right now.",
			},
		},
		[441]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I think I'm gonna go and get changed.”",
			},
		},
		[442]={
			{
"Out of consideration, Akari disappears into the shop without another word.",
			},
		},
		[443]={
			{
"For a while longer, Koyuzu continues to cry in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[444]={
			{
"Once her tiny sobs finally subside, I let go of her.",
			},
		},
		[445]={
			{
"But Koyuzu silently grabs on to my shirt, as though unwilling to be apart from me.",
			},
		},
		[446]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Can we stay like this... a little while longer?”",
			},
		},
		[447]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[448]={
			{
"Once again, I fold her into my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[449]={
			{
"Koyuzu sighs contentedly, rubbing her nose against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[450]={
			{
"It tickles, but I don't let go of her.",
			},
		},
		[451]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I think... I might be feeling a little lonely.”",
			},
		},
		[452]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I won't be able to spend as much time with you anymore...”",
			},
		},
		[453]={
			{
"Koyuzu softly murmurs, her face still buried in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[454]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“...A-Actually, I lied. I'm not just a little lonely...”",
			},
		},
		[455]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'm ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"very",
{"/font"},
" lonely...”",
			},
		},
		[456]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I want to keep being together with you.”",
			},
		},
		[457]={
			{
"Just because she got her spellblade back doesn't mean her loneliness will go away.",
			},
		},
		[458]={
			{
"In fact, spending time together with me might have only reminded her of the past.",
			},
		},
		[459]={
			{
"Reminded her of the irretrievable time she spent living with her family.",
			},
		},
		[460]={
			{
"At least, that's how I feel.",
			},
		},
		[461]={
			{
"The time I spent with Koyuzu was like a dream─a dream of living together with the family no longer present in my memories.",
			},
		},
		[462]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, what do you say about moving in?”",
			},
		},
		[463]={
			{
"If I remember correctly, there's still a vacant room on the upper floor.",
			},
		},
		[464]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[465]={
			{
"Koyuzu suddenly raises her head.",
			},
		},
		[466]={
			{
"Her reddened eyes look up at me with wonderment.",
			},
		},
		[467]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's also living here, so I'm sure it'll ease your loneliness.”",
			},
		},
		[468]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And of course, I'll be happy having you by my side.”",
			},
		},
		[469]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all up to you, though.”",
			},
		},
		[470]={
			{
"Finally realizing what I'm saying, Koyuzu's face lights up before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[471]={
			{
"If she moves into the spare room above the shop, we'll naturally be able to spend a lot more time together.",
			},
		},
		[472]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“C-Can I really?”",
			},
		},
		[473]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, we'll need to check with the manager first.”",
			},
		},
		[474]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll go ask him right away!”",
			},
		},
		[475]={
			{
"Koyuzu dashes off into the back of the shop.",
			},
		},
		[476]={
			{
"She returns just a few moments later.",
			},
		},
		[477]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san!”",
			},
		},
		[478]={
			{
"Koyuzu leaps into my chest.",
			},
		},
		[479]={
			{
"Unable to contain her happiness, she flings her arms around my back in a tight embrace.",
			},
		},
		[480]={
			{
"I already know what the answer's going to be, but I might as well ask anyway.",
			},
		},
		[481]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What'd he say?”",
			},
		},
		[482]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“He was all for it!”",
			},
		},
		[483]={
			{
"Koyuzu beams at me, her smile as vibrant as a blossoming flower.",
			},
		},
		[484]={
			{
"The sight of it brings an involuntary smile to my own face.",
			},
		},
		[485]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I can't wait to start living together!”",
			},
		},
		[486]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll go fetch my things right away!”",
			},
		},
		[487]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really don't need to be in that much of a rush.”",
			},
		},
		[488]={
			{
"But seeming to not have heard me, Koyuzu is already dashing off.",
			},
		},
		[489]={
			{
"The manager comes out from the back, taking her place.",
			},
		},
		[490]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh? What happened to Ina-san?”",
			},
		},
		[491]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She went home to bring over her things.”",
			},
		},
		[492]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“What a bundle of energy.”",
			},
		},
		[493]={
			{
"The manager chuckles to himself.",
			},
		},
		[494]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun, you can just keep paying the same rent for one. Consider it a little freebie.”",
			},
		},
		[495]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A freebie?”",
			},
		},
		[496]={
			{
"Not catching his meaning, I stare back at the manager.",
			},
		},
		[497]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've only ever been paying rent for one.”",
			},
		},
		[498]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh? But I was told by Ina-san that you'd be living together.”",
			},
		},
		[499]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[500]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, that's not what I meant when I asked Koyuzu to...”",
			},
		},
		[501]={
			{
"It sounds like Koyuzu misunderstood my suggestion that she move in with me.",
			},
		},
		[502]={
			{
"I explain my rationale to the manager.",
			},
		},
		[503]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ahaha, for a covert operative, Ina-san sure is an impulsive one.”",
			},
		},
		[504]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, we're fresh out of rooms anyhow.”",
			},
		},
		[505]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh? Wasn't there still a vacancy?”",
			},
		},
		[506]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's been spoken for as of yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[507]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Why don't you go right ahead and live together until a new vacancy pops up?”",
			},
		},
		[508]={
			{
"The manager grins at me suggestively.",
			},
		},
		[509]={
			{
"I look in the direction Koyuzu ran off to, but she's already out of sight.",
			},
		},
		[510]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(How am I supposed to explain this to Akari?)”",
			},
		},
		[511]={
			{
"Hotori will probably have some choice words for me as well.",
			},
		},
		[512]={
			{
"But when I recall the sight of Koyuzu's smile, I decide that it might not be so bad to live together with her.",
			},
		},
		[513]={
			{
"Several days have passed since Koyuzu moved in with me.",
			},
		},
		[514]={
			{
"In that time, she's become more attached to me than ever before.",
			},
		},
		[515]={
			{
"Whenever I sit down, she sits on my lap.",
			},
		},
		[516]={
			{
"Whenever I lie down, she lies down next to me.",
			},
		},
		[517]={
			{
"Whenever I do push-ups, she climbs on my back.",
			},
		},
		[518]={
			{
"It's cute, so I let her get away with it.",
			},
		},
		[519]={
			{
"Just as I was thinking about Koyuzu, she slides the door open.",
			},
		},
		[520]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Welcome back.”",
			},
		},
		[521]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'm... I'm home...”",
			},
		},
		[522]={
			{
"Just like always, Koyuzu sidles up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[523]={
			{
"It's her signal that she wants me to pet her on the head.",
			},
		},
		[524]={
			{
"Without fail, she always begs for this whenever she comes back to the room.",
			},
		},
		[525]={
			{
"But today, she's acting different from usual.",
			},
		},
		[526]={
			{
"Rather than demurely standing next to me, she immediately flings her arms around my chest.",
			},
		},
		[527]={
			{
"She refuses to let me go no matter how long I wait, fidgeting restlessly all the while.",
			},
		},
		[528]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Nnh... nmhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[529]={
			{
"She lets out one labored sigh after another, hugging me tighter and tighter.",
			},
		},
		[530]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[531]={
			{
"Taking her by the shoulders and peering into her face, I notice her brightly flushed cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[532]={
			{
"Her eyes are swimming with tears, and her breathing is hard and ragged.",
			},
		},
		[533]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you have a fever?”",
			},
		},
		[534]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Nnmh...”",
			},
		},
		[535]={
			{
"She lets out a tiny whimper when I touch my palm to her forehead.",
			},
		},
		[536]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why is Kogitsunemaru still active?”",
			},
		},
		[537]={
			{
"Koyuzu has her fox ears and tail.",
			},
		},
		[538]={
			{
"Even though Kogitsunemaru is fully sheathed.",
			},
		},
		[539]={
			{
"The flow of spellforce should be cut off.",
			},
		},
		[540]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san...”",
			},
		},
		[541]={
			{
"Koyuzu clings to me once again.",
			},
		},
		[542]={
			{
"Burying her nose in my chest, she sniffs in my scent.",
			},
		},
		[543]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[544]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Using Kogitsunemaru... has some side effects.”",
			},
		},
		[545]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“If it isn't Honed properly after intensive use, this is what happens.”",
			},
		},
		[546]={
			{
"Koyuzu answers my question through her ragged breaths.",
			},
		},
		[547]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How are you feeling more specifically? Does your head hurt?”",
			},
		},
		[548]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I can't tell... It feels like my body is on fire... and I can't think straight at all...”",
			},
		},
		[549]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How can you fix it?”",
			},
		},
		[550]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I don't know... This is the first time it's actually happened to me...”",
			},
		},
		[551]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Nmmhh...”",
			},
		},
		[552]={
			{
"She seems to be really suffering.",
			},
		},
		[553]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I just, um... want you to hug me more.”",
			},
		},
		[554]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[555]={
			{
"I do as I'm told and hold Koyuzu tight.",
			},
		},
		[556]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haah, hahh... hug me... tighter...”",
			},
		},
		[557]={
			{
"Despite what she says, I'm afraid that I'll break her if I put in any more strength.",
			},
		},
		[558]={
			{
"Her breathing is even more ragged than before.",
			},
		},
		[559]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haah, nngh, aahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[560]={
			{
"Koyuzu whimpers even louder than before, her entire body trembling like a leaf.",
			},
		},
		[561]={
			{
"Seemingly unable to remain standing on her feet, she crumples down on the futon.",
			},
		},
		[562]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You okay? Hey, Koyuzu!”",
			},
		},
		[563]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Nngh... nmghh...”",
			},
		},
		[564]={
			{
"She reaches a hand towards her nether regions.",
			},
		},
		[565]={
			{
"Startled, I reflexively look away.",
			},
		},
		[566]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu... what are you...”",
			},
		},
		[567]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry... When I touch myself here... I feel a little better...”",
			},
		},
		[568]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Aahh... I can't believe I'm doing this... right in front of you...”",
			},
		},
		[569]={
			{
"Could it be that Kogitsunemaru's side effect is stimulating its wielder's libido?",
			},
		},
		[570]={
			{
"Perhaps the way to put Koyuzu back to normal is to satisfy her desires.",
			},
		},
		[571]={
			{
"But the question remains whether I can really allow myself to do that...",
			},
		},
		[572]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ahaah, nngh, ahhh, argh... fwaah...”",
			},
		},
		[573]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Nghh, Tokita-san, Tokita-san...! Ahh, hahh, nnmh, nhah...”",
			},
		},
		[574]={
			{
"Koyuzu moans my name deliriously.",
			},
		},
		[575]={
			{
"All the while, she continues moving her fingers, rubbing herself through her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[576]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Will doing that make you feel better?”",
			},
		},
		[577]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes... I-I think so...”",
			},
		},
		[578]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hyah, aaah... nghh, haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[579]={
			{
"Sure enough, the more her desires are satisfied, the more the magicks seem to dissipate.",
			},
		},
		[580]={
			{
"Gasping for breath, Koyuzu stares up at me with tearful eyes.",
			},
		},
		[581]={
			{
"Her eyes brim with a passion the likes of which I've never seen before.",
			},
		},
		[582]={
			{
"At the same time, her tail is wagging vigorously beside her.",
			},
		},
		[583]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[584]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“When you hugged me, my body got so hot... that I\ncouldn't hold myself... hyaahn!”",
			},
		},
		[585]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san... I want y-you to...”",
			},
		},
		[586]={
			{
"She whispers through hot breaths.",
			},
		},
		[587]={
			{
"Her lips quiver with desire, a trickle of drool dripping from her open mouth.",
			},
		},
		[588]={
			{
"Her eyes transfix me with their bewitching light.",
			},
		},
		[589]={
			{
"When I rise the next morning, Koyuzu is already preparing to head out.",
			},
		},
		[590]={
			{
"Her fox ears and tail have vanished completely, and there\ndon't seem to be any problems with Kogitsunemaru, either.",
			},
		},
		[591]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Good morning, Tokita-san.”",
			},
		},
		[592]={
			{
"When she sees that I'm up, she trots over happily.",
			},
		},
		[593]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is your body feeling all right?”",
			},
		},
		[594]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh? My body?”",
			},
		},
		[595]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“There's no problems in particular... Should there be?”",
			},
		},
		[596]={
			{
"Don't tell me she doesn't remember what happened last night.",
			},
		},
		[597]={
			{
"Boy, how am I supposed to explain this?",
			},
		},
		[598]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san.”",
			},
		},
		[599]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[600]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“*Smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[601]={
			{
"Koyuzu clings to my neck and gives me a kiss.",
			},
		},
		[602]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I gave all of my firsts to you, Tokita-san.”",
			},
		},
		[603]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“If I ever end up like yesterday, I'm counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[604]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tehee.”",
			},
		},
		[605]={
			{
"Leaving me with a mischievous smile, Koyuzu dives out the open window.",
			},
